<p>Your P2P Ad has been automatically paused after being active for 24 hours.</p>

<table
    width='100%'
    cellpadding='10'
    cellspacing='0'
    style='background-color: #f9f9f9; border-radius: 5px; margin-top: 15px; border: 1px solid #eeeeee;'
>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Ad Type</td>
        <td style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right;'>{{adType}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Currency</td>
        <td style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right;'>{{currency}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Exchange Rate</td>
        <td
            style='font-weight: bold; text-align: right; font-size: 18px;'
        >₦{{price}}/{{currency}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Remaining Amount</td>
        <td style='text-align: right;'>{{currency}} {{remainingAmount}}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td style='color: #666;'>Status</td>
        <td style='text-align: right; font-weight: bold; color: #ff9800;'>PAUSED</td>
    </tr>
</table>

<p
    style='margin-top: 20px; padding: 10px; background-color: #e3f2fd; border-left: 4px solid #2196f3; font-size: 14px;'
>
    <strong>Why was my ad paused?</strong><br />
    This is a safety measure to ensure you're still available to complete trades. Ads are
    automatically paused after 24 hours of being active.
</p>

<p style='margin-top: 15px;'>
    <strong>What should I do?</strong><br />
    If you're still available to trade, you can reactivate your ad anytime from your P2P dashboard.
</p>

<div style='margin-top: 20px; text-align: center;'>
    <a
        href='{{dashboardUrl}}'
        style='display: inline-block; padding: 12px 30px; background-color: #4caf50; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;'
    >
        Reactivate Ad
    </a>
</div>